        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 4341, Colored Glass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Romantic Colored Glass Cabinet Knob is truly elegant. The flowing design defines sophistication--the free-flowing movement of the glass heightening the grace of the piece. This Colored Glass Cabinet Knob will look great in almost every decor, incorporating lovely detail without looking too over-the-top. It is available in 4 color choices (Transparent, Rose, Azure, or Jade) each of which can come either clear or frosted with either a polished brass or polished chrome base.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/globe-colored-glass-cabinet-knob-omnia-4405\"><b>Globe Colored Glass Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Romantic Colored Glass Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>OMN-4341/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>OMN-4341/40</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
